  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Administration of the Council for Development Policy 2024 and 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grant will cover expenses related to meetings in the Council for Development Policy in 2024 and 2025, including transportation, accommodation, catering and remuneration to the members of the Council. 

The annual remuneration for the Council members is distributed as follows: 
-	Chair of the Council: DKK 100,096 (at 2012 levels)
-	Deputy Chair of the Council: DKK 62,280 (at 2012 levels)
-	Ordinary members: DKK 54,400 (at 2012 levels)

The grant will also cover expenses related to a duty travel for the Council to Kenya and Ethiopia in April 2024 and a yearly seminar for the Council in 2024 and 2025. Duty travels for the Council are usually organised once every three years and have previously taken place in 2017 and 2022 (delayed due to COVID-19).</narrative>
  </description>
